      "html": null,
      "text": "Extended Stay Legal Comfort Package"
     }
    },
    {
     "propertyId": "6641f4cd-e0a1-50a4-7c21-0c2924814323",
     "type": "Rich Text",
     "label": "Items/Item 1 Text",
     "text": {
      "html": "<div><div data-w-id=\"f9b48c4e-be9c-0dca-e1a9-9ddf59632462\"><div data-w-id=\"1371c28d-0f57-b827-8faf-9ba4406ea8c0\">Entire floor reservation for full confidentiality</div><div data-w-id=\"a42e9774-77f0-ed14-22c3-193f78786c4b\">Optional private outdoor terrace</div><div data-w-id=\"5555e5ee-f3a2-4196-9627-dfbeed006bbf\">Enhanced security and exclusive guest access</div><div data-w-id=\"d068ea4b-e5af-77d1-2fb8-1342c09d7378\">Custom space layout and meeting room allocation</div></div><p data-w-id=\"afad5a51-8aa8-3fa3-9995-2b311e4c1822\"></p></div>",
      "text": null
     }
    },
    {
     "propertyId": "af838336-9b52-2e13-c029-42ce918a8efd",
     "type": "Rich Text",
     "label": "Items/Item 2 Text",
     "text": {
      "html": "<div><div data-w-id=\"cdb3f0ed-a87d-6b19-414a-32cc88d5f15b\"><div data-w-id=\"435b63b5-4a4d-be34-1bf6-f87c3e084232\">Dedicated meeting rooms or suites for legal teams</div><div data-w-id=\"a3bfabfe-aee4-75d3-e3ee-a84b7fb45c07\">High-speed internet and full AV capabilities</div><div data-w-id=\"eb756a06-6ea5-e182-797f-d85389512294\">On-demand printing, copying, and secure storage</div><div data-w-id=\"d3c1244a-3547-d221-2350-ba7b293e5e38\">Round-the-clock access to working areas</div></div><p data-w-id=\"7d73a520-9137-8820-8edf-bee4446558ad\"></p></div>",
      "text": null
     }
    },
    {
     "propertyId": "7f61040c-583e-d94e-aefd-7c95d13e6849",
     "type": "Rich Text",
     "label": "Items/Item 3 Text",
     "text": {
      "html": "<div><div data-w-id=\"4ea4927c-7298-e2df-3184-612cf63d8bc9\"><div data-w-id=\"b5080387-ef04-1b55-e99b-4b3be29a84be\">Custom in-room amenities for long trials</div><div data-w-id=\"ab93d939-a276-1ccf-ac77-f427cd13ab34\">Daily housekeeping or modified schedules</div><div data-w-id=\"8488b5b9-1a73-b9af-1cf9-d99d7dfde158\">Wellness options to support mental clarity and team morale</div><div data-w-id=\"4b88fd0e-9dde-7ff5-6e6a-dc09b45b5ad6\">Discounted dining packages and meal coordination</div></div><p data-w-id=\"cb7a91e4-9962-237f-9011-d7e20ab0d13f\"></p></div>",
      "text": null
     }
    }
   ]
  },
